dde-printer (1.0.20+agino6-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Do not show the share widget as a window before it is in the layout: it was mapped as a short-lived top-level window while the main window was built, took the startup notification, and the main window opened on the primary screen instead of the screen the printer manager was launched from (agino D-258).

 -- agino Team <admin@aginoos.com>  Mon, 09 Nov 2026 23:50:00 +0800

dde-printer (1.0.20+agino5-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Drop the 201-page Uniontech FAQ PDF and the help-popup entry that opened it. agino excludes /usr/share/deepin-manual/* (no deepin-manual viewer), so the file was never installed and the entry did nothing.
  * Do not install the deepin-manual assets by default (INSTALL_MANUAL=1 at build time brings them back). The package shrinks from 11.6 MB to 1.6 MB.

 -- agino Team <admin@aginoos.com>  Wed, 04 Nov 2026 01:00:00 +0800

dde-printer (1.0.20+agino4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Troubleshooting: the printer connection check and the "add printer by IP" probes (JetDirect, LPD) ignore the desktop proxy (all_proxy / system proxy), a printer is on the local network.
  * Troubleshooting: the CUPS error-log check starts the on-demand manager service instead of reporting it unavailable (QDBusInterface is invalid while the service is not running).
  * PrinterTestJob: disconnect the job-state signal with the signature it was connected with.

 -- agino Team <admin@aginoos.com>  Tue, 03 Nov 2026 22:00:00 +0800

